  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "25600372",
      "title": "Getting Started with Fetching Data",
      "sourceHash": "76e9eac797b40fd3e2fab038f6063849d8f642a69fcb826478386f5fd8e215f3",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.04,
          "end": 4.18,
          "en": "Now what we learned about funks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.18,
          "end": 6.45,
          "en": "and funk action creators,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.45,
          "end": 8.86,
          "en": "so these action creator functions here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.86,
          "end": 10.93,
          "en": "Now, did we learn about that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.93,
          "end": 14.77,
          "en": "let's build a app action creator that fetches the cart",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.77,
          "end": 17.15,
          "en": "when the application loads.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.15,
          "end": 19.88,
          "en": "Because at the moment we're only sending data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.88,
          "end": 22.83,
          "en": "but we never fetched data when the application load.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.83,
          "end": 27.61,
          "en": "And therefore, if we reload, all our state is still lost",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.61,
          "end": 29.79,
          "en": "and that's of course not the goal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.79,
          "end": 32.26,
          "en": "Now we can ride that code in the component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.26,
          "end": 33.84,
          "en": "or as action creator,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.84,
          "end": 36.84,
          "en": "but here I now wanna stick to action creators",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.84,
          "end": 40.01,
          "en": "and hence we can add a second function cart slice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.01,
          "end": 42.75,
          "en": "But since this file is now getting bigger and bigger,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.75,
          "end": 45.81,
          "en": "I'm a fan of creating a separate file for that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.81,
          "end": 48.93,
          "en": "Let's maybe name it cart-actions.js,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.93,
          "end": 50.83,
          "en": "of course, the file name is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.07,
          "end": 55.59,
          "en": "I'll then copy this sendCartData function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.59,
          "end": 57.78,
          "en": "cut it from cart-slice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.78,
          "end": 61.14,
          "en": "and added it cart-actions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.14,
          "end": 64.54,
          "en": "and now we need to import UI actions here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 64.54,
          "end": 68.47,
          "en": "So in cart-slice, I'll get rid of that import, cut that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.47,
          "end": 71.72,
          "en": "and add that in cart-actions instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.72,
          "end": 73.88,
          "en": "And in app.js, we therefore now need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 73.88,
          "end": 75.03,
          "en": "to import sendCartsData",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76.2,
          "end": 78.65299999999999,
          "en": "from store/cart-actions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 79.65,
          "end": 82.21000000000001,
          "en": "And then I'll add my app action creator function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 82.21000000000001,
          "end": 85.07,
          "en": "in this cart-actions file as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 85.07,
          "end": 88.08,
          "en": "So that could be the fetctCardData function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 89.16,
          "end": 90.61,
          "en": "and I'll also export that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 90.61,
          "end": 93.08,
          "en": "because we'll need it somewhere else as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 93.08,
          "end": 96.9,
          "en": "And just as before that will immediately return a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 96.9,
          "end": 99.08,
          "en": "which gets dispatched as an argument",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 99.08,
          "end": 101.33,
          "en": "and then does something else.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 101.33,
          "end": 105.08,
          "en": "Now here we could then also dispatch some notifications",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 105.08,
          "end": 106.52000000000001,
          "en": "if we want to do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 106.52000000000001,
          "end": 108.7,
          "en": "but actually here I'll not do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 108.7,
          "end": 111.47999999999999,
          "en": "Instead I'll create a new function, fetchData,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 115.09,
          "end": 117.71000000000001,
          "en": "and have nested function which is async",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 117.71000000000001,
          "end": 119.56,
          "en": "because I'll use the fetch API",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 119.56,
          "end": 123.15,
          "en": "and I wanna wrap a fetchData with try catch it after",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 123.15,
          "end": 126.13,
          "en": "that's why I'm putting it into a separate function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 126.13,
          "end": 129.54,
          "en": "So then we await fetch action get a response here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 129.54,
          "end": 132.01,
          "en": "and wanna fetch by sending a request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 132.01,
          "end": 134.21,
          "en": "to that same URL again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 135.14,
          "end": 137.51,
          "en": "but this time it should be a get request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 137.51,
          "end": 140.67000000000002,
          "en": "So we don't need to add this configuration object then",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 140.67000000000002,
          "end": 142.38,
          "en": "as a second parameter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 142.38,
          "end": 145.113,
          "en": "because I get request is the default, anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 146.88,
          "end": 150.53,
          "en": "Instead this time I am now interested in the data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 150.53,
          "end": 152.89,
          "en": "so in the result of calling await",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 153.89,
          "end": 155.84,
          "en": "response.Json",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 155.84,
          "end": 157.54,
          "en": "but of course, I also still wanna check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 157.54,
          "end": 160.9,
          "en": "if the response is maybe not okay for whatever reason",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 160.9,
          "end": 163.74,
          "en": "and if that should be the case I'll throw a new error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 164.63,
          "end": 168.163,
          "en": "where I say, \"could not fetch cart data\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 169.26,
          "end": 171.463,
          "en": "something like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 172.93,
          "end": 176.24,
          "en": "Now, if we make it pass this line of code here though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 176.24,
          "end": 178.31,
          "en": "we have the data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 178.31,
          "end": 180.87,
          "en": "and I will then return it here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 180.87,
          "end": 182.31,
          "en": "I'll return it here because",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 182.31,
          "end": 185.15,
          "en": "that is not a separate nested function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 185.15,
          "end": 188.743,
          "en": "Hence here I'll then try executing fetchData",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 189.85,
          "end": 192.893,
          "en": "and catch any errors we might be getting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 194.72,
          "end": 195.78,
          "en": "And if we get an error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 195.78,
          "end": 198.76,
          "en": "we still might wanna show the error in notification.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 198.76,
          "end": 203.32999999999998,
          "en": "So I'll then dispatch this error notification action again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 203.32999999999998,
          "end": 204.193,
          "en": "down here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 205.06,
          "end": 207.567,
          "en": "but I'll say, \"fetching carts data failed.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 208.66,
          "end": 213.007,
          "en": "If we however, are the try block or await fetchData,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 213.92000000000002,
          "end": 215.76,
          "en": "I can do this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 215.76,
          "end": 218.893,
          "en": "if I turned this into an async function, which we can,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 220.05,
          "end": 221.63,
          "en": "Redux supports that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 221.63,
          "end": 224.98,
          "en": "that dysfunction which we returned here is async.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 224.98,
          "end": 226.78,
          "en": "So we can use await here as well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 226.78,
          "end": 230.7,
          "en": "and that gives me my cart data then",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 230.7,
          "end": 233.727,
          "en": "because I'm returning the data which we pass here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 235.034,
          "end": 238.95,
          "en": "and there for now I wanna use that cart data to set my cart.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 239.89,
          "end": 241.81,
          "en": "Now, the cart data we're fetching,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 241.81,
          "end": 245.35,
          "en": "we'll have that format which is stored on Firebase",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 245.35,
          "end": 247.1,
          "en": "and that's the format which we're sending",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 247.1,
          "end": 248.91,
          "en": "to Firebase of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 248.91,
          "end": 251.87,
          "en": "It will be this cart, which we're sending there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 251.87,
          "end": 254.05,
          "en": "so it is an object with the items key,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 254.05,
          "end": 257.54,
          "en": "with in an array inside and a total quantity key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 257.54,
          "end": 260.09,
          "en": "Which is exactly the format we need here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 260.09,
          "end": 262.58,
          "en": "in our front-end as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 262.58,
          "end": 265,
          "en": "Which is no surprise because we are sending",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 265,
          "end": 267.06,
          "en": "that Redux state snapshot",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 267.06,
          "end": 269.61,
          "en": "as data to the back and at the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 269.61,
          "end": 273.33,
          "en": "So we automatically get back correctly formatted data here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 273.33,
          "end": 277.03,
          "en": "and we don't need to transform that Firebase data first",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 277.03,
          "end": 281.33,
          "en": "because it has the format, we sent to Firebase earlier.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 281.33,
          "end": 284.476,
          "en": "That's different from other sections in the course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 284.476,
          "end": 287.59000000000003,
          "en": "here we had to transform Firebase data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 287.59000000000003,
          "end": 291.97,
          "en": "because there we used post for a sending our data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 291.97,
          "end": 293.64,
          "en": "not put as we're doing here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 293.64,
          "end": 296.85,
          "en": "and hence we let Firebase create a list of data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 296.85,
          "end": 300.01,
          "en": "which turned out to be an object when we fetched it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 300.01,
          "end": 303.62,
          "en": "You might remember that from the HTTP section in the course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 303.62,
          "end": 308.04,
          "en": "here with put we're sending our data snapshots to Firebase",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 308.04,
          "end": 311.45,
          "en": "and Firebase will take it as it is and store it like it is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 311.45,
          "end": 312.83,
          "en": "without changing it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 312.83,
          "end": 316.46,
          "en": "So when we then fetch it, we also have to correct structure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 316.46,
          "end": 319.72,
          "en": "and hence this cart data is correctly formatted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 319.72,
          "end": 324.72,
          "en": "and therefore now, we can use this replace cart reducer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 324.73,
          "end": 328.03,
          "en": "which I provided to you earlier in this module",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 328.03,
          "end": 330.28,
          "en": "to replace our front-end cart",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 330.28,
          "end": 332.77,
          "en": "with the cart we're loading from Firebase",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 333.61,
          "end": 335.68,
          "en": "and replace cart expects a payload",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 335.68,
          "end": 337.28,
          "en": "which has a total quantity",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 337.28,
          "end": 340.54,
          "en": "and an items field which is exactly the data structure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 340.54,
          "end": 342.75,
          "en": "we're fetching from Firebase.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 342.75,
          "end": 347.75,
          "en": "So, in cart-actions, we just wanna import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 347.84000000000003,
          "end": 350.62,
          "en": "our cart-actions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 351.82,
          "end": 354.5,
          "en": "from the cart slice,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 354.5,
          "end": 357.633,
          "en": "so these automatically generated actions now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 359.48,
          "end": 364.48,
          "en": "And here, I then wanna dispatch cart-actions replace,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 364.92,
          "end": 367.58,
          "en": "not remove, replace cart",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 367.58,
          "end": 370.28,
          "en": "and pass my carts data as a payload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 370.28,
          "end": 373.563,
          "en": "which as mentioned has the correct structure already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 374.85,
          "end": 377.41,
          "en": "Now we could have done all to show to success notification",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 377.41,
          "end": 380.47,
          "en": "but I don't wanna do that, I just wanna use the cart data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 380.47,
          "end": 381.963,
          "en": "and we're good to go.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 383.12,
          "end": 387.82,
          "en": "With all that done, we now just need to call fetch cartData",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 387.82,
          "end": 390.09,
          "en": "somewhere in our application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 390.09,
          "end": 393.95,
          "en": "to start fetching our cartData from Firebase.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 393.95,
          "end": 397.56,
          "en": "And again, app.js is probably a good place for that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 397.56,
          "end": 400.5,
          "en": "Here we already have a user fact call",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 400.5,
          "end": 403.27,
          "en": "and that we wanna start fetching data here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 403.27,
          "end": 405.68,
          "en": "if this application loads.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 405.68,
          "end": 408.53,
          "en": "We could do that here in this isInitial check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 408.53,
          "end": 411,
          "en": "because dad will only run if it's the first time",
          "zh": ""
        },
